  "post_content": "<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/2015/09/IMG_0795.jpg\" style=\"width: 480px; height: 320px;\" /></p>\n<p>(28 fotos) Este mi&eacute;rcoles, 9 de septiembre, Carnicer&iacute;a Rub&eacute;n ha abierto sus puertas en la calle del Carmen, 30 de Onda, junto al jard&iacute;n de Cervantes,&nbsp;con las mejores carnes de Zucaina, embutidos ib&eacute;ricos y artesanales, pero tambi&eacute;n con pan a muy buen precio, rosquilletas, papas y conservas.</p>\n<p></p>\n<div class=\"galeria-ngg\" style=\"display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px;\"><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/carnisseriarubenmartinez/img_0791.jpg\" alt=\"img_0791\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/carnisseriarubenmartinez/img_0792.jpg\" alt=\"img_0792\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/carnisseriarubenmartinez/img_0793.jpg\" alt=\"img_0793\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/carnisseriarubenmartinez/img_0794.jpg\" alt=\"img_0794\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/carnisseriarubenmartinez/img_0795.jpg\" alt=\"img_0795\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/carnisseriarubenmartinez/img_0796.jpg\" alt=\"img_0796\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/carnisseriarubenmartinez/img_0798.jpg\" alt=\"img_0798\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/carnisseriarubenmartinez/img_0800.jpg\" alt=\"img_0800\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/carnisseriarubenmartinez/img_0801.jpg\" alt=\"img_0801\" style=